number: XXIII
name: The Vessel
path: M1 6a2.887 2.887 0 0 1 5 0 2.887 2.887 0 0 0 5 0M3.5 1v7.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 5 0V1
uprightMeaning: measure, blending, slow level
reversedMeaning: spilled measure, churn, excess
tags: season:spring, element:water, gem:sapphire, flower:orchid
flavor: Water between two jars. Neither holds it for long.

--- upright
The water passes between the jars. Each pour is the same weight. The one who pours has been doing so for longer than the work has taken.
---

--- reversed
The pour overshoots the rim. The water finds the floor. What was meant to be measured is now distributed by accident.
---
